## 0.2.0

whats-new-0-2-0-sheet = The daily sheet is tighter: one surface, a chip for each prayer time, times you can fold away, and counts you can type.
whats-new-0-2-0-open = Tap the open count to see only the deeds you have not marked yet.
whats-new-0-2-0-reminders = Prayer reminders on the web. Sign in, turn them on in Settings, and werdy reminds you after each adhan.
whats-new-0-2-0-watch = Ask someone to watch your deeds, or ask to watch theirs, with their Google email. They see your request when they sign in.
whats-new-0-2-0-reports = Reports now read at a glance: one headline, a bar for each day, your strongest and weakest deeds, and your prayers.
whats-new-0-2-0-levels = The three Academy level sheets are now ready sets you can add to your sheet.
